<th class="small-12 large-12 columns first last" style="margin: 0px auto; padding: 20px 20px 10px; width: 650px; text-align: left; color: #555554; line-height: 20px; font-family: Microsoft JhengHei, Tahoma, Arial, Helvetica, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 400; vertical-align: top; background-color: #fefefe;">
<table style="padding: 0px; width: 100%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; border-collapse: collapse; border-spacing: 0;">
<tbody>
<tr style="padding: 0px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top;">
<th style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-align: left; color: #555554; line-height: 20px; font-family: Microsoft JhengHei, Tahoma, Arial, Helvetica, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 400;">
<p style="margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; text-align: left; color: #555554; line-height: 20px; font-family: Microsoft JhengHei, Tahoma, Arial, Helvetica, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 400; border-collapse: collapse !important; -ms-word-break: keep-all; -ms-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; -webkit-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">感謝您提交 Intel® 夥伴聯盟的會員申請</p>
<p style="margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; text-align: left; color: #555554; line-height: 20px; font-family: Microsoft JhengHei, Tahoma, Arial, Helvetica, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 400; border-collapse: collapse !important; -ms-word-break: keep-all; -ms-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; -webkit-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">我們可能需要三個工作天的時間才能審核並回應您的申請，確切時間取決於您申請的是新的或現有的商業帳戶</p>
<p style="margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; text-align: left; color: #555554; line-height: 20px; font-family: Microsoft JhengHei, Tahoma, Arial, Helvetica, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 400; border-collapse: collapse !important; -ms-word-break: keep-all; -ms-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; -webkit-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">一旦您的權益配置妥當，<b>您就會收到一封電子郵件，通知您可登入合作夥伴入口網站</b>，並體驗成為 Intel® 夥伴聯盟會員的所有優勢</p>
<p style="margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; text-align: left; color: #555554; line-height: 20px; font-family: Microsoft JhengHei, Tahoma, Arial, Helvetica, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 400; border-collapse: collapse !important; -ms-word-break: keep-all; -ms-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; -webkit-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">如果您在上述時間過後仍未收到電子郵件，請聯絡<a href="https://www.intel.com.tw/content/www/tw/zh/support/contact-support.html">支援部門</a></p><!--<p style="margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; text-align: left; color: #555554; line-height: 20px; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 400; border-collapse: collapse !important; -ms-word-break: keep-all; -ms-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; -webkit-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">
If you have any questions, please contact us at <a href="https://programs@intel.com" style="color:#FF0000;">programs@intel.com.</a><br>

</p>--> <!--<p style="margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; text-align: left; color: #555554; line-height: 20px; font-family: Microsoft JhengHei, Tahoma, Arial, Helvetica, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 400; border-collapse: collapse !important; -ms-word-break: keep-all; -ms-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; -webkit-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;"><a href="http://www.intel.com/partner" style="color:#FF0000;">Verify now</a><br> --><p style="margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; text-align: left; color: #555554; line-height: 20px; font-family: Microsoft JhengHei, Tahoma, Arial, Helvetica, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 400; border-collapse: collapse !important; -ms-word-break: keep-all; -ms-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; -webkit-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">
</p></th></tr>
<tr><td style="line-height: 20px; font-family: Microsoft JhengHei, Tahoma, Arial, Helvetica, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 400;color: #555554;">
<br>謹致<br>您的 Intel&reg;&nbsp;夥伴聯盟團隊</td></tr> 

